  "專案工作證與工作現場照片": "Project badge and workplace photos",
  "透過產業 AI 工具、能源管理系統競品與 AI 功能模組比較，我們把聊天機器人從搜尋入口重新定位成工作流程介面，協助使用者找出問題來源、診斷異常、做出節能決策。": "By comparing industry AI tools, energy-management competitors, and AI feature modules, we reframed the chatbot from a search entry point into a workflow interface that helps users identify issues, diagnose anomalies, and make energy-saving decisions.",
  "01 / 產業 AI 工具提供的互動模式": "01 / Interaction Patterns from Industry AI Tools",
  "從 4 個產業 AI 工具中整理出可借鏡的互動模式：摘要、洞察、建議與告警。這些能力可轉化成能源管理場景中的資料理解與主動提醒。": "Four industry AI tools revealed reusable interaction patterns: summaries, insights, recommendations, and alerts. These capabilities can support data understanding and proactive reminders in energy-management workflows.",
  "02 / 能源管理與設備管理競品分析": "02 / Energy and Equipment Management Competitors",
  "市場上的能源管理系統已開始把設備監控、能源分析、成本最佳化與 AI 洞察整合在同一個工作流程中。": "Energy-management systems are increasingly combining equipment monitoring, energy analysis, cost optimization, and AI insights within a single workflow.",
  "03 / AI 功能比較與設計機會": "03 / AI Feature Comparison and Design Opportunities",
